  "preparation_method": "Each private v7 session was created with the final core by cold-booting its unchanged full original ROM, using physical keyboard inputs and ordinary production USB Wire uploads of two self-authored Notes. The core checkpoint was saved without editing guest state, with USB disconnected and NOTE CATALOG visible.",
  "browser_method": "The ordinary ROM input and Restore confirmation load that same-ROM session. Visible Connect USB, transfer menu, Receive, Stop and Download controls are used. Stock SEND and later arithmetic use only on-screen physical calculator keys. A bounded read-only NativeWorker message observer records status and copies the last LCD frame; no Worker request or result is synthesized.",
  "file_comparison": "Both entire HP39BinC downloads compare byte for byte against their respective prepared binary Notes, including the headers, high bytes, literal backslash and trailing NUL. No header differences are waived in these two cases.",
