  "limits": [
    "The browser restores genuine cold-boot-generated sessions; it does not repeat the complete cold boot inside Chrome.",
    "This browser witness covers ordinary Note SEND for the two specified original ROMs over USB. Multipart aplets/libraries, programs, serial, capacity limits and fault injection have separate evidence or remain outside this witness.",
    "The actual Stop acknowledgement and retention path is exercised here. Deliberately delayed cross-thread delivery and capacity-boundary races remain covered by the dedicated Controller/Worker and component regressions.",
    "The read-only observer adds main-thread work. The run is a functional witness, not an unobserved performance measurement.",
    "Intermediate SEND-menu screenshots can show an earlier published LCD frame and are not used as visual proof of the selected transport. Stable post-transfer download and arithmetic screenshots were reviewed.",
    "Private ROMs, session bytes, returned Note files and screenshots are not included in this public evidence."
  ],
